{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "09b2dab65334edc388d4c877746aa892ad41ccc851901e88efd66b9c373048ad", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、結婚式をテーマにした撮影。\n白無垢を着られるとあってエミリーも張り切っている）", "zh": "（今天的工作是拍摄以婚礼为主题的节目。\n听说能穿上白无垢，艾米莉也干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "38d17e8a2c22f62698e13369c8dbdd173c6b62a15dab07963072314878c44efd", "ja": "Wow！　見てください、仕掛け人さま！\n素敵なお庭ですね♪", "zh": "Wow！您快看呀，策划人阁下！\n好漂亮的庭院呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f768772ed08aec59a6c12286bfb93a244ad19af1682ba96118829057419d3075", "ja": "確かに、雰囲気がいいな。このホテルが\n結婚式場として人気だというのも、わかる気がするよ。", "zh": "确实，氛围很好。这家酒店作为婚礼场地那么受欢迎，我觉得不难理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "14f3b376701dd25292d4a5cdc872120dabaf79eca4c3a05a91f5e0dbb48d692e", "ja": "美しく整えられた庭の植栽に、芝、石造りの階段……\nどれも、劇場で見た小冊子のとおりです。", "zh": "整齐美观的庭院绿植、草坪、石砌阶梯……\n和剧场里看到的小册子上写的一模一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "471d526253681eb5fdd4f98a7b6e14861f8e5cd06d2cae055e210037fda6fa9b", "ja": "仕掛け人さまも、ご覧になりましたか？", "zh": "制作人先生也看过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d0959deba861c64e069ada3be00d0fc14dfbb8ab395dabe01c4d2b1e813c9e09", "ja": "もちろん目を通したよ。それにしても、\n撮影がそんなに楽しみなのか？　エミリー。", "zh": "当然看过了。不过话说回来，\n你对这次拍摄有那么期待吗？艾米莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "eec39b6425cf449b87609ec244afbb8a33a62948861f898ba4858ded3f27fcae", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！\nだって、白無垢が着られるんですよ？", "zh": "是的，当然啦！\n因为能穿上白无垢嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c30a594726aab37425111b174151f5801c949d5c8f0bfeedd337e473379809a2", "ja": "白無垢は、伝統のある婚礼衣装です。\n無垢に角隠し、綿帽子。そして色打掛でのお色直し。", "zh": "白无垢是拥有悠久传统的婚礼服饰。\n无垢装束配上角隐和绵帽。之后还要换上色打挂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "cc35e8ee5e7ff5bbf2cf1657183cf1373f051e1970d91acf429a3dfe81a0f4c5", "ja": "いつか、お仕事で着る機会があるかもしれないと\n思っていましたが……まさかこんなに早く叶うなんて。", "zh": "我原本想着，以后或许能有机会\n在工作里穿上……没想到竟然这么快就能实现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1009_p", "source_sha256": "95d46de9a46a8e15ca4358f4b72931f7ddea21c4b548514dd2cf24211810f240", "ja": "うん……確かに今のエミリーの年齢だと、\n結婚するには早すぎるからな。", "zh": "嗯……确实，以艾米莉现在的年纪来说，结婚还太早了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1010_p", "source_sha256": "de16843cc794c66f81ecb29c7612315028a18ae8e8115997d64dce0bb986992f", "ja": "けど、だからこそ、結婚への純粋な憧れを\n表現できると思うんだ。頑張ってくれ！", "zh": "不过，也正因为如此，我觉得才能表现出对婚姻的纯粹憧憬。加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "0cde18eb03fb75116005bed8687b6868b57c5c5fb36c99cd97408a9eb8dff3e9", "ja": "わかりました！\nはぁ……とっても楽しみです……♪", "zh": "明白了！\n哈啊……真是让人无比期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4d1857cca6f5ce1be4ac623c9c5b9d33c6b999164b38aad64e3fff18dd2c63da", "ja": "正に、夢心地って感じだな……。\n楽しみなのは、わからなくもないけど。", "zh": "简直就像身处梦境一样……。\n你这么期待，也不是不能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "875e01c281ab1f7f3634167c4a47ef41703f3f9db323280d86a5a7969724924b", "ja": "えっ？\n……仕掛け人さまも、楽しみだったんですか？", "zh": "诶？\n……原来制作人先生也很期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1014_p", "source_sha256": "86f675afc259578a98bc33ce7b697b6edd97be92867e81666813e71cea8233e3", "ja": "もちろん！　撮影とはいえ、\nエミリーの花嫁姿を見られるからな。", "zh": "当然！虽然是拍摄工作，但能看到艾米莉的新娘装扮嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "e62998ab781c4dfb8a5f41a7c3db55cfe692cb86f0060523d2d754dbe4f837a4", "ja": "まあ……！　どうしましょう。そんなふうに\n言われると、なんだか緊張してきてしまいます……。", "zh": "哎呀……！这可怎么办才好。被你这么一说，不知不觉就开始紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5f7ecf53c8baa6c379494529ce21ba5b5a890fd48ba2293ef8f9e14f73cfd5c6", "ja": "あっ、ごめん。でも、期待しているのは本当だよ。\nエミリーなら、きっと素敵な花嫁になると思う。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。不过，我是真的很期待哦。\n我觉得如果是艾米莉，一定会成为一位出色的新娘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "20691e682ca9a6fad33f8cbb53e7730df9f803a11a5bf96121b476fd3b2d0eb3", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……はい、ありがとうございます！\n私、ご期待に添えるようにがんばりますね♪", "zh": "制作人……嗯，谢谢您！\n我会努力不辜负您的期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c4e7536a56541a9db27809d5e1a6ea3d0213252b1fce49e2e56af431296f7109", "ja": "頼んだぞ！　エミリーの花嫁姿で、\nみんなを幸せな気持ちにしてほしい。", "zh": "拜托你了！希望你能用艾米莉的新娘装扮，让大家感到幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "de8fdcd8beca0ae932a597930f28ac2998a40f58632ce22b696d0d59f0c242b4", "ja": "幸せな気持ちに……責任重大ですね。\nけど、わかりました！", "zh": "幸福的心情……真是责任重大呢。\n不过，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0193_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "f834ff053b5cacca1985b6603999262902e8c081324e42e92461f28a14cb941f", "ja": "私、大和撫子として、立派に白無垢を着てみせます！\n仕掛け人さま、どうか見守っていてくださいね♪", "zh": "我会作为大和抚子，漂漂亮亮地穿上白无垢的！\n幕后推手大人，请您好好看着我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
